  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to be able to reference TextMeshPro from Udon.\nBeing able to manipulate character-by-character in scripts would allow us to create things like kinematic typography, which would result in a wider range of world representations.\nShaders can do this to some extent, but scripting is often easier.\nkinematic typography\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinetic_typography\nRotate a character by character in TextMeshPro [Japanese]\nhttps://gurutaka-log.com/unity-textmeshpro-rotate",
